 "utterances": [
  {
   "start": 2.12,
   "end": 5.62,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Morning, everyone. Friday at last. Can you all hear me?"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.16,
   "end": 9.26,
   "speaker_id": "p10",
   "speaker": "Olumide Adeyemi",
   "text": "Yeah, bit tinny, but you're there."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.22,
   "end": 11.42,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Unfortunately, yes."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.86,
   "end": 19.16,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Lovely. Whose new car's that in the car park, then? Taking up about a space and a half."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.01,
   "end": 24.21,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Not mine. Mine's the one worth less than the tyres on that."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.06,
   "end": 28.16,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "It's parked diagonally for extra prestige."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.8,
   "end": 35.1,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Never mind the car, the heating in the portakabin's absolutely roasting. I've got the window open in April."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.1,
   "end": 39.25,
   "speaker_id": "p10",
   "speaker": "Olumide Adeyemi",
   "text": "You've found the only warm bit of the factory."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.61,
   "end": 43.11,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Yeah, apparently all the heat's been allocated to my chair."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.17,
   "end": 51.87,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Right, before we get into heating policy. Marcus Hale and Sarah Okafor aren't with us today. Dave, how are you getting on?"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.52,
   "end": 60.17,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Yeah, so the risk assessment for work on the GT2 Inlet Water Injection Valve, I've updated that. All done."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.03,
   "end": 63.23,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Good, cheers."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.31,
   "end": 68.86,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "And CV01, jam's cleared and I've checked the sensors. All fine, that's sorted."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.15,
   "end": 71.35,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Ah, good."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.14,
   "end": 80.19,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Only other thing from me, I heard a slight rattle from the Main Water Isolation Valve. Nothing to action yet, just an observation."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.57,
   "end": 82.77,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Okay, understood. Hannah?"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.43,
   "end": 90.38,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "The pressure-drop investigation, I'm still on it. Got a bit further with it, going fine so far."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.78,
   "end": 93.58,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Thanks. Olu, you had an update as well?"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.5,
   "end": 101.1,
   "speaker_id": "p10",
   "speaker": "Olumide Adeyemi",
   "text": "Yeah, the replacement parts from Northfield. Went over, picked them up, all done. No issues found."
  },
  {
   "start": 101.98,
   "end": 104.43,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Nice. An uneventful parts run, for once."
  },
  {
   "start": 106.77,
   "end": 112.37,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "And I've made a start on organising the toolbox talk for the team. That's ticking along."
  },
  {
   "start": 113.34,
   "end": 114.54,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Okay, cheers."
  },
  {
   "start": 116.43,
   "end": 126.23,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "One from the boss, in her absence: the sensor recalibration on the heater box on one is moving over to Hannah Price. Hannah, you okay taking that over?"
  },
  {
   "start": 127.31,
   "end": 129.41,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll take over that recalibration."
  },
  {
   "start": 129.83,
   "end": 131.58,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Thanks. Right, today's new bits."
  },
  {
   "start": 131.98,
   "end": 140.73,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "First, stores Jamie, can you sort the permit to work and isolation for the pick and place on two? That one's safety critical, straight away."
  },
  {
   "start": 142.78,
   "end": 147.68,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Yeah. You mean sorting both the permit and the isolation, not just the paperwork?"
  },
  {
   "start": 148.56,
   "end": 150.66,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Both, yeah. That's the immediate one."
  },
  {
   "start": 152.43,
   "end": 158.73,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Understood, I'll sort the permit to work and isolation for the pick and place on two straight away."
  },
  {
   "start": 161.03,
   "end": 163.48,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Yeah, sensible. No ambiguity on that one."
  },
  {
   "start": 165.71,
   "end": 166.91,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Exactly."
  },
  {
   "start": 168.41,
   "end": 172.26,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Okay, I'm with you. What else have you got for me?"
  },
  {
   "start": 174.03,
   "end": 184.18,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Jamie, can you go to Kestrel in Leeds to pick up the replacement parts for the feed pump after lunch? That's holding production up so it needs doing first."
  },
  {
   "start": 186.33,
   "end": 192.98,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Yep, I'll go to Kestrel in Leeds after lunch and pick up the replacement parts for the feed pump."
  },
  {
   "start": 195.18,
   "end": 197.98,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Yeah, that's the production hold-up at the minute."
  },
  {
   "start": 199.66,
   "end": 201.76,
   "speaker_id": "p10",
   "speaker": "Olumide Adeyemi",
   "text": "Sorry, first as in before the—"
  },
  {
   "start": 204.22,
   "end": 211.92,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "No, sorry, talking over you. Safety one straight away. After lunch, the parts run needs doing first because production's waiting on it."
  },
  {
   "start": 212.43,
   "end": 216.28,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Got you. Immediate safety bit, then the collection first after lunch."
  },
  {
   "start": 218.75,
   "end": 221.2,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Friday in Leeds. Living the dream, Jamie."
  },
  {
   "start": 222.29,
   "end": 225.44,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Oh, absolutely. All the glamour ends up in stores."
  },
  {
   "start": 227.58,
   "end": 235.63,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Last one, stores Jamie: can you do the lock-out tag-out sign-off on the little water valve on two for Monday? Top priority please."
  },
  {
   "start": 237.86,
   "end": 244.51,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll do the lock-out tag-out sign-off on the little water valve on two for Monday. Top priority, understood."
  },
  {
   "start": 245.67,
   "end": 248.12,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Sorry, was that Monday? Your audio clipped."
  },
  {
   "start": 249.28,
   "end": 250.48,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Monday, yes."
  },
  {
   "start": 252.97,
   "end": 255.07,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "That's clear. Three for me, then."
  },
  {
   "start": 256.55,
   "end": 257.75,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yep, those three."
  },
  {
   "start": 260.12,
   "end": 262.22,
   "speaker_id": "p10",
   "speaker": "Olumide Adeyemi",
   "text": "Audio's gone a bit underwater again."
  },
  {
   "start": 264.48,
   "end": 267.28,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Might just be how we sound by Friday."
  },
  {
   "start": 269.58,
   "end": 272.73,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "No, definitely Teams. Though I wouldn't rule it out."
  },
  {
   "start": 274.38,
   "end": 278.23,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Right, we'll leave it there before I turn into a submarine."
  },
  {
   "start": 278.57,
   "end": 279.77,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Cheers, everyone."
  },
  {
   "start": 280.07,
   "end": 281.27,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Cheers."
  },
  {
   "start": 283.33,
   "end": 284.53,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Thanks all. Bye."
  }
 ],
